    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Kevin,\n\nI previously wrote about keeping clients informed as their cases progress. This article explores why AI tools alone may not improve that experience.\n\nThe bigger change is often deciding who owns each step, what information they need, and when a lawyer intervenes. That's shaping how we help PI firms adopt AI at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/-DS1JZn-aQ\n\nAs a co-founder at Quill & Arrow, would choosing the tools or changing the team's routines be the harder part? I'd value your perspective.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: M C submitted a Google review about Quill & Arrow",
